WEBVTT

00:14:57.843 --> 00:15:01.180
what's happening on the sphere 
of social networks

00:15:01.180 --> 00:15:03.040
and cybersecurity and AI.

00:15:03.624 --> 00:15:08.604
Dr. Hasnah, you are the President 
of Hamad Bin Khalifa University in Doha,

00:15:08.604 --> 00:15:10.327
which is part of Qatar Foundation

00:15:10.327 --> 00:15:12.877
but is a big institution 
on its own right.

00:15:12.877 --> 00:15:14.187
Tell us a little about it.

00:15:15.315 --> 00:15:18.925
So, Hamad Bin Khalifa University, 
which is a 10-year institution,

00:15:18.925 --> 00:15:22.845
came to complete the cycle 
of education and research

00:15:22.845 --> 00:15:23.975
within the Foundation.

00:15:23.975 --> 00:15:26.365
So, as I said, the Education City

00:15:26.365 --> 00:15:30.444
has students from K to 12 
and to undergrad.